    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Netherlands-based 3D animation and illustration studio, a duo of Victoria Young (UK-born, Central Saint Martins / KABK exchange) and Niels van der Donk; founded 2021 in The Hague. Specialises in VR-sculpting (Quill/Meta Quest) to produce character-driven 3D animation, editorial illustration and idents. Clients include Google, Spotify, Nickelodeon, Nike (W+K), Sprite (W+K Sao Paulo/The Youth), Selfridges, Meta, Wired, NYT, Amazon (Droga5). Won multiple Gold/Silver/Bronze One Club awards for Sprite Spriteverse campaign. Featured by It's Nice That, Creative Review. Spoke at Pictoplasma 2023, DEMO festival. LinkedIn: two searches found no company page; YONK do not appear to maintain one. IG context shot returned login wall (headless rate-limited); queued to ig-queue.json (@yonk.online).",
